OL,3,GNEWSAMan's body found in village
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man's body has been found in an East
OL,6,FYorkshire village.
OL,8,FHumberside Police said a scene guard
OL,9,Fwas in place near to Pocklington Lane
OL,10,Fin Burnby after the discovery at about
OL,11,F15:15 BST on Wednesday.
OL,13,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said
OL,14,FPocklington Household Waste Recycling
OL,15,FSite, which is on Pocklington Lane, was
OL,16,Fclosed.
OL,18,FInquiries are ongoing and the man's
OL,19,Fdeath was being treated as unexplained,
OL,20,Fthe force said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
